        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Jet-Lag-Mist-Model_c9fb2fa7-45f5-4739-a5c0-3f573d74480a.jpg",
        "media_aspect_ratio_mobile": "square",
        "media_aspect_ratio_desktop": "taller",
        "media_fullwidth_mobile": false,
        "media_caption": "",
        "content": "<p>Two new Jet Lag essentials just landed—we’re so excited to introduce Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist and Jet Lag Deep Hydration Serum. Your new go-to skincare products for instant, on-the-go hydration—anytime, anywhere.</p><h2><strong>Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist</strong></h2><p>What is Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist?</p>",
        "content_smaller": "<p>This refreshing, ultra-fine mist soothes, comforts and provides moisture barrier support—leaving the skin dewy and hydrated. Effortlessly lock in moisture, relieve dryness and soothe skin with every spray. Keep it in your bag to refresh makeup on the go or whenever your skin feels irritated and dry.<br/><br/>Its weightless formula is non-comedogenic, fragrance-free, and has received the National Eczema Association Seal of Acceptance™.</p>",
        "content_left": "",
        "content_right": "",
        "content_bottom": "",
