    "content_mXUFDG": {
      "type": "content",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 4.8,
        "padding_top_desktop": 0,
        "padding_bottom_desktop": 8.4,
        "content": "<h2>Find Your Eye Product</h2><p>If you already swear by our award-winning<a href=\"/products/light-aura-vitamin-c-peptide-eye-cream\" title=\"Light Aura Vitamin C + Peptide Eye Cream\"> Light Aura Vitamin C + Peptide Eye Cream</a>, you may be wondering how Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum is different, and if you actually need both in your routine.</p><p>Light Aura Eye Cream was formulated to brighten and depuff the eye area, leaving it perfectly primed for makeup or concealer, and an essential step for your morning routine. Powered by a vitamin C and peptide blend, it visibly brightens the entire eye area, while caffeine helps de-puff, for a refreshed and replenished look.</p><p>Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum was formulated to be used only at night due to its gentle-yet-effective retinol blend, that helps to improve the appearance of wrinkles. Over time, the skin around the eye area will appear less crepey and more even.<br/>Add both products to your AM and PM routines for your brightest, most-hydrated eyes yet.</p>",
        "font_size": "normal",
        "container": "small",
        "paragraph_margins": "normal",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_wrap": "normal"
